1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,170
If this parasite gets inside a fish,

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,210
it can replace its entire tongue.

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:05,770
It crawls through the gills,

4
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,030
latches onto the tongue,

5
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,720
and starts stealing its blood.

6
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,430
Eventually, the tongue withers away.

7
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,650
But here’s the disgusting part.

8
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,750
The parasite stays attached,

9
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,540
becoming the fish’s new tongue.

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:19,340
And the fish keeps eating,

11
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,540
with a living parasite inside its mouth.

